{"minVersion":"0.1","headerImage":"https://qnblackcat.github.io/repo/assets/com.qn.zalowatchalert_iphoneos-arm64/banner.png","tintColor":"","tabs":[{"tabname":"Details","views":[{"class":"HiddenDepictionScreenshotsView","screenshots":[],"itemCornerRadius":8,"itemSize":false},{"markdown":"# ZaloWatchAlert\nG\u1eedi th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o \u0111\u1ea9y l\u00ean Watch trong l\u00fac cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi Zalo \u0111ang \u0111\u1ed5 chu\u00f4ng, \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f2n bi\u1ebft \u0111ang c\u00f3 cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ebfn Zalo:\n- \u0110\u1ea9y th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o k\u00e8m t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi g\u1ecdi m\u1ed7i 2 gi\u00e2y trong khi m\u00e1y \u0111ang b\u00e1o cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi \u0111\u1ebfn.\n- Ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u1edbi c\u1ea3 cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi tho\u1ea1i v\u00e0 video.\n- Ch\u1ec9 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng khi iPhone \u0111ang kho\u00e1. Khi b\u1ea1n \u0111ang d\u00f9ng iPhone, cu\u1ed9c g\u1ecdi hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean iPhone nh\u01b0 b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng g\u1eedi g\u00ec sang Watch.\n- T\u1ef1 d\u1eebng v\u00e0 xo\u00e1 th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o khi b\u1ea1n nghe, t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i, ng\u01b0\u1eddi g\u1ecdi c\u00fap m\u00e1y, ho\u1eb7c b\u1ea1n m\u1edf kho\u00e1 iPhone l\u00fac \u0111ang \u0111\u1ed5 chu\u00f4ng.\n","useSpacing":"true","class":"DepictionMarkdownView"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionHeaderView","title":"Information"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Developer","text":"Qn"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Version","text":"0.1.0"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Compatibility","text":"iOS 15.0 or later"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"Section","text":"Tweaks"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionTableButtonView","title":"View Source Code","action":"https://github.com/qnblackcat/ZaloWatchAlert","openExternal":"true","tintColor":""},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionTableButtonView","title":"Contact Support